OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to 'devoted dad'
OL,4,Aafter fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a pedestrian who died
OL,7,Ffollowing a suspected hit-and-run crash
OL,8,Fhave paid tribute to a "devoted dad".
OL,10,FSteve Cook, 67, was hit by a car on
OL,11,FPark Street in Hull at about 17:30 GMT
OL,12,Fon 31 October. He was taken to hospital
OL,13,Fbut died the next morning.
OL,15,FThe driver of the vehicle, a
OL,16,F21-year-old man, was arrested on
OL,17,Fsuspicion of causing death by dangerous
OL,18,Fdriving and failing to stop. He has
OL,19,Fsince been released on conditional
OL,20,Fbail, pending further inquiries.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
