OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to 'devoted dad'
OL,4,Aafter fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, Cook's family described
OL,7,Fhim as "a loving husband, devoted dad
OL,8,Fand proud grandad who brought so much
OL,9,Fjoy to everyone around him".
